---
layout: layouts/base.njk
supporting: true
navSection: blog
permalink: /blog/
title: Pantory Blog — Pantry organization & inventory guides
description: Practical guides to keeping track of food in your pantry, fridge, and freezer, from Pantory.
---
<div class="supporting-page reading-wrap">
  <header class="page-intro"><p class="section-label">Pantory blog</p><h1>Keep track of your food.</h1><p>Practical guides to organizing your pantry, fridge, and freezer.</p></header>
  {% if collections.posts.length %}
  <ol class="post-list" aria-label="Articles, newest first">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <li><article><p class="post-date"><time datetime="{{ post.data.date | dateISO }}">{{ post.data.date | dateLabel }}</time></p><h2><a href="{{ post.url | assetUrl }}">{{ post.data.title | escape }}</a></h2><p>{{ post.data.description | escape }}</p><p class="post-author">By {{ post.data.author | escape }}</p></article></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  {% else %}
  <section class="blog-empty" aria-labelledby="empty-heading"><h2 id="empty-heading">No articles yet.</h2><p>Our first guide is still to come. Check back for practical advice on keeping track of your food.</p><a href="{{ 'features/' | assetUrl }}">Explore Pantory’s features</a></section>
  {% endif %}
</div>
